=======================================================================
Model weights
=======================================================================

Model weights (speech recognition, speaker diarization and, in the future,
speech synthesis) are not part of this repository and are not covered by the
MIT license of V. The user downloads them explicitly from their upstream
sources. Their sources, licenses and verification status are listed in
docs/licenses/models.md.

Attribution for the speaker-embedding model used by local diarization
(downloaded by the user on request, not redistributed by V):

  wespeaker_en_voxceleb_resnet34_LM.onnx
  WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM speaker-embedding model trained on VoxCeleb,
  by the WeSpeaker project (https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker),
  licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), as stated in
  WeSpeaker's docs/pretrained.md. No changes made by V.
  Training data: VoxCeleb1 and VoxCeleb2, Visual Geometry Group,
  University of Oxford (https://www.robots.ox.ac.uk/~vgg/data/voxceleb/).
  Citations are listed in docs/licenses/models.md, section 3.3.

